[{"title":"阳山大雹","author":"吕本中","text":"建炎庚戌正月尾，阳山雨雹大如李。\n疾雷先驱风御随，顷刻云屯遍千里。\n初疑地轴开九渊，固阴惊蛰神龙起。\n又恐帝出发震怒，下扫炎荒除疠鬼。\n破窗穿牖□□横，触石摧林势难比。\n疑是晓色方窥檐，惨澹复黑迷巾履。\n披衣欲兴还就枕，?磕崩腾喧两耳。\n吾君圣德过成康，胡虏凭陵殊未已。\n中原郡邑半丘墟，铁骑犹思犯南鄙。\n安得天威假庙谟，恢复两河端可俟。","collection":"宋","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":13087,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"谒韩文公庙阳山","author":"吕本中","text":"雄文峙华嵩，高词灿星斗。\n孝思古人齐，名出当时右。\n少小怀经纶，志气颇自负。\n束带入柏台，极力排奸丑。\n谗言如青蝇，正立无所苟。\n贬官宰阳山，万里困奔走。\n松竹罗县斋，黄卷不离手。\n地偏难蛮风，吏民归化诱。\n至今数百年，流俗独淳厚。\n山川发清奇，与公俱不朽。\n我来拜遗像，肴蔬荐芳酒。\n指石哦公诗，一洗胸中垢。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":13088,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游会胜寺蒙泉","author":"吕本中","text":"去郡十五里，满山蔽青松。\n朝来雨初过，萧瑟鸣悲风。\n踏泥转溪曲，路尽山无穷。\n层崖筑栏阁，宛在云烟中。\n引水绕砌下，濆石常飞濛。\n寻幽到寺背，苍碧摩高空。\n古甃冽寒泉，浅沙影重重。\n伏流尚数步，暗与溪相通。\n潺湲去何之，可折从此东。\n会有到海期，岂计朝莫功。\n我行因避贼，眺览聊从容。\n徘徊未忍去，僧饭催撞钟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":13089,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"连州游隅湖亭","author":"吕本中","text":"附溪翳嘉木，濒溪引清流。\n如何几亩田，委曲林泉幽。\n乱石际高下，森列如戈矛。\n青色染黛浅，映水疑欲浮。\n危亭跨绝壁，广榭排荒丘。\n我来雨初过，远山云半收。\n百花开已尽，桑柘鸣晴鸠。\n不知汝颍间，还有此景不。\n踌躇思痛饮，沃洗胸中愁。\n明朝傥未去，提壶再来游。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":13090,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"奉观超然居士面面亭唱和新句辄成近体诗上呈","author":"吕本中","text":"我老日已懒，君闲宁废诗。\n尘埃久无梦，苔竹旧相知。\n早晚春犹在，追随病不宜。\n因观七字句，尚足乐晨饥。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":13091,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送李惇秀才","author":"吕本中","text":"有口莫饮朝市水，有脚莫踏红尘地。\n市朝之水不可饮，尘埃一涴无由洗。\n十年阅世真梦寐，一日逢君得欢喜。\n自嫌急雨倒晴雷，且愿浊河露清泚。\n君行此去道庐山，为我作诗山两间。\n寒泉夜听鸣玦环，刬茅后池种白莲。\n更约洪谢林汪潘，徐李欲去不作难。\n倚松闻之亦解颜，我且往矣君先还。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":13092,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"元日雪中作","author":"吕本中","text":"老病昏昏闲不出，山后山前雪三日。\n人家闭户作新年，一饱经营苦无术。\n朝地附火读阳秋，笺注纷罗添一忧。\n未减少年穷事业，青灯分坐写蝇头。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":13093,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送王周士","author":"吕本中","text":"病欲驰驱转不宜，只今筋力十分衰。\n平生轗轲老更甚，此去艰难心自知。\n苛痒未除妨摄念，交游虽近废论诗。\n明年更欲寻公去，同上衡山过九疑。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":13094,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄小范","author":"吕本中","text":"高卧终无策，翻书谩作缘。\n相望如一日，不见已三年。\n事少知心远，居门觉地偏。\n明年得安静，为子下临川。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":13095,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"奉赠伯世仲志二弟 其一","author":"吕本中","text":"我已蹉跎不及闲，百年遗范子犹存。\n故知前辈风流远，世世传家有外孙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":13096,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"奉赠伯世仲志二弟 其二","author":"吕本中","text":"往时天未丧斯文，吾祖声名更绝群。\n内外诸孙几人在，不应如我便无闻。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":13097,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送张子直西归 其一","author":"吕本中","text":"年来衰病只深藏，转觉闲居气味长。\n所恨浮生有拘绊，不能相逐上瞿塘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":13098,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送张子直西归 其二","author":"吕本中","text":"君家兄弟各能文，季也风流又绝群。\n万里相逢又相别，落花时节却思君。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":13099,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送张子直西归 其三","author":"吕本中","text":"朋从索寞厌分离，老去心情祇自知。\n记取上饶相望处，小桥南路往来时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":13100,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送张子直西归 其四","author":"吕本中","text":"亲旧留连莫厌频，并江花絮已残春。\n定知数到尝新酒，未有工夫忆故人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":13101,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"谢赵士原送酒 其一","author":"吕本中","text":"小雨生凉挽未回，只愁残暑闷风雷。\n老人端坐气如缕，更进先生雨一杯。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":13102,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"谢赵士原送酒 其二","author":"吕本中","text":"早来取酒瓶已空，对盏不复能从容。\n出门更值督邮苦，住鬲犹憎琥珀浓。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":13103,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"谢赵士原送酒 其三","author":"吕本中","text":"老来疾病与时添，苦怕香醪如蜜甜。\n安得泻瓶清似水，主人应未笑无厌。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":13104,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"谢赵士原送酒 其四","author":"吕本中","text":"爱君好句能胜酒，顾我无心久似灰。\n老病深藏如怯暑，未妨初伏送诗来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":13105,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"邦杰惠砚纸墨三物谨成古体诗一首上谢","author":"吕本中","text":"歙溪孕石成縠纹，歙山松煤烟入云。\n敲冰落手卷盈轴，顿使几案生清芬。\n魏侯哦诗日更好，静到溪山未枯槁。\n肯分三物到幽人，不留自起太玄草。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":13106,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"燕龙图画山水歌","author":"吕本中","text":"燕公画山水，名在能品中。\n至今笔墨欲飞动，妙处不与丹青同。\n巴陵六月风暴起，咫尺长江欲千里。\n鱼龙变怪鲛鳄怒，细草长林恣鞭箠。\n断云却挂悬石上，急雨正堕荒崖里。\n想见行人弝檐时，亦有野店临沙觜。\n渔子回头叹失色，霜女无言欣一洗。\n问公何处得此妙，长剑出匣须天倚。\n公不见簿书丛中尘埃多，归思颇遭贫病魔。\n念今新凉江始波，如此万水千山何。\n为公试作吴兴歌，更觅神仙张志和。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":13107,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"初夏即事","author":"吕本中","text":"但见溪山如画里，不知风景是它乡。\n苦遭毒暑三年旱，预喜西风一榻凉。\n俗事不须频到口，旧书何苦要撑肠。\n雨声只在芭蕉上，正与愁人作夜长。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":13108,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"晚出","author":"吕本中","text":"小雨收残暑，低云隐莫雷。\n聊乘野兴出，复为故人回。\n旱日晚难好，秋花愁正开。\n论诗已奇事，犹恨不胜杯。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":13109,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠赵九弟","author":"吕本中","text":"独居少还往，况此阴雨天。\n疏篱闭岑寂，昼永不得眠。\n芳菲随手尽，乐事缺周旋。\n赵郎远过我，千里一蓬船。\n温姿破残梦，妙语争春妍。\n喜逢骨肉亲，懒初新少年。\n平生金石交，惟尔未改前。\n君看嵇与阮，感概后代传。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":13110,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄李商老","author":"吕本中","text":"渌涨西河可纵篙，春光无信费诗招。\n香烟缭绕重城静，月影攲斜半夜潮。\n好鸟似闻昆弟语，垂杨初放女儿腰。\n无人与语当时事，兴尽江南大小乔。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":13111,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"喜宗师诸公数见过分韵得席字","author":"吕本中","text":"野水春未生，积雪晴已滴。\n翛然六尺床，正可容一席。\n诸公数往还，未厌诗酒溺。\n短檠有新功，妙语乃破的。\n鲙槃约纤红，茗碗乱晴碧。\n虽无费百金，亦有饮一石。\n尚念山堂老，病鸟藏羽翼。\n生平馀习在，种种见排斥。\n荒城满泥潦，亦可试幽屐。\n明当袖诗往，先尽一醉力。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":13112,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"巫山图歌","author":"吕本中","text":"君不见我家壁上六幅图，淡墨寒烟半江水。\n上有巉然十二峰，乃似突兀当空起。\n幽花妩媚闭泥土，乱石峥嵘入荆杞。\n巫山县下水到天，神女庙前江接连。\n溪流去与飞瀑乱，屋角却对寒崖悬。\n阳台昨梦不知处，只今饥鸦迎客船。\n饥鸟受食不肯去，舟子欣然得神护。\n晓镜新妆敛旧屏，亦有馀红点荒树。\n病夫坐稳便幽禅，每见此画心茫然。\n文章事业已罢倦，少日气味无寅缘。\n楚王不作宋玉死，莫雨朝云千万年。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":13113,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"将去济阴寄泗上宁陵","author":"吕本中","text":"淮海三年别，家山十日程。\n时思一笑乐，转觉异乡情。\n叔父勤相唤，诸郎许见迎。\n浊醪行处有，所恨不同倾。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":13114,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宿石头多宝寺","author":"吕本中","text":"四山环其外，一峰屹当中。\n支径转屈曲，云峰踏飞鸿。\n僧居架苍崖，高下潜相通。\n昏钟罢香火，馀音袅寒空。\n梅开何处花，吹香到帘栊。\n回望云山城，木杪残阳红。\n愁心易生感，满耳唯松风。\n对酒成浩歌，漂零见涂穷。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":13115,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"兵乱后自嬄杂诗 其二","author":"吕本中","text":"羽檄连朝莫，戎旃匝迩遐。\n未教知死所，讵所作生涯。\n东郭同逃户，西郊类破家。\n萍蓬无定迹，屡欲过三巴。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":13116,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"兵乱后自嬄杂诗 其三","author":"吕本中","text":"胡骑猖狂甚，连年窥西京。\n贪饕期竭泽，剪戮遂盈城。\n国论多遗策，人情罢请缨。\n有谁似南八，血指众心惊。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":13117,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"兵乱后自嬄杂诗 其四","author":"吕本中","text":"庐舍经兵火，头颅尚在门。\n风掀灰?迹，月涩剑铓魂。\n鼠穴频遭断，燕巢犹半存。\n看花泪盈眼，宁忍复开尊。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":13118,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"兵乱后自嬄杂诗 其五","author":"吕本中","text":"碣石豺狼种，长驱出不虞。\n是谁遗此贼，故使乱中都。\n官府室如磬，人家锥也无。\n有司少恩惠，何忍复追呼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":13119,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"兵乱后自嬄杂诗 其六","author":"吕本中","text":"叛将斩关入，通衢列众兵。\n军声逐飞瓦，杀气暗前旌。\n事定愁方剧，身危梦尚惊。\n乾坤空纳纳，何处寄馀生。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":13120,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"兵乱后自嬄杂诗 其七","author":"吕本中","text":"将士承恩泽，临危勿择安。\n牛衣寒卧易，马革裹尸难。\n破虏陈奇计，策勋超达官。\n兜鍪未可忽，从古出貂冠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":13121,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"兵乱后自嬄杂诗 其八","author":"吕本中","text":"夷甫终隳晋，群胡迫帝居。\n王纲板荡后，国势土崩初。\n戈戟连梁苑，头颅塞浚渠。\n天心应助顺，侧听十行书。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":13122,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"兵乱后自嬄杂诗 其十","author":"吕本中","text":"兵馀门巷静，亲故白头新。\n常与贫为侣，祇将愁送春。\n焚车绝此事，推宅望何人。\n便得长安信，相看眉一伸。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":13123,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"兵乱后自嬄杂诗 其十一","author":"吕本中","text":"国命方屯厄，吾曹何所依。\n白驹将老至，黄鸟恨春归。\n柳巷清阴合，花蹊红蕊稀。\n主忧闻未解，涕泗望天畿。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":13124,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"兵乱后自嬄杂诗 其十二","author":"吕本中","text":"江城朝夕闭，里巷绝人行。\n骄虏未归塞，凶渠犹弄兵。\n正须烽火息，早罢阵云横。\n胡孽将销蕴，吾君幸圣明。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":13125,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"兵乱后自嬄杂诗 其十三","author":"吕本中","text":"四郊多属垒，何地可逃生。\n水水但争渡，城城各点兵。\n牛亡罢春种，马夺尽徒行。\n囊櫜经钞掠，寇来浑不惊。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":13126,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"兵乱后自嬄杂诗 其十五","author":"吕本中","text":"一纪幽栖地，宛然高树林。\n比邻风雨散，垣屋草莱深。\n池面华光歇，井床苔色侵。\n衰年筋力弱，阁道罢登临。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":13127,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"兵乱后自嬄杂诗 其十六","author":"吕本中","text":"一廛江上宅，毁撤自群凶。\n卜筑劳心计，携锄失指踪。\n鸠啼□□景，花敛带愁容。\n何日休兵革，重来依老农。","collection":"宋","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":13128,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"兵乱后自嬄杂诗 其十七","author":"吕本中","text":"遭乱心纡郁，那堪茅舍空。\n百年窘食事，一旦堕兵戎。\n授简惭词客，据鞍成老翁。\n欲逃无所适，朝夕泣涂穷。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":13129,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"兵乱后自嬄杂诗 其十八","author":"吕本中","text":"汾阳六甲士，率众出中都。\n欲使亲平虏，翻成远避胡。\n操戈取金币，夺马载妻孥。\n汝自违天意，何缘保汝躯。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":13130,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"兵乱后自嬄杂诗 其十九","author":"吕本中","text":"春宅屯兵后，荒墟非故居。\n陶门柳径短，阮舍竹阴疏。\n风雨无由障，牛羊自入庐。\n朝廷安反侧，何日降恩书。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":13131,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"兵乱后自嬄杂诗 其二十","author":"吕本中","text":"平世多忘战，今真得阵梁。\n燕云拥豺虎，陆晋失金汤。\n汉将争奔北，胡兵尚崛强。\n何当合馀烬，戮力共勤王。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":13132,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"兵乱后自嬄杂诗 其二十一","author":"吕本中","text":"闾巷经鏖战，空馀池上亭。\n檐楹镞可拾，草木血犹腥。\n云汉悲鸿雁，郊原愧鹡鸰。\n白头两兄弟，各未保残龄。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":13133,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"兵乱后自嬄杂诗 其二十二","author":"吕本中","text":"嬖孽开边隙，羌胡恃衅端。\n天戈增照耀，国步向平安。\n骑吹春容远，孤烽战气残。\n妖星稍退舍，便览老怀宽。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":13134,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"兵乱后自嬄杂诗 其二十三","author":"吕本中","text":"乱后惊身在，端如犬丧家。\n沈吟悲世故，寂默对春华。\n堤外鸦藏柳，栏中蜂动花。\n今宵眠未稳，馀寇尚纷拿。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":13135,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"兵乱后自嬄杂诗 其二十四","author":"吕本中","text":"君父围城内，忽逾三月期。\n六龙时?卼，百雉日孤危。\n报国宁无策，全躯各有词。\n旄头渐低小，早晚定班师。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":13136,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"兵乱后自嬄杂诗 其二十五","author":"吕本中","text":"乱离仍再岁，未敢有吾庐。\n林下休官久，草间求活初。\n迹虽寄戎旅，心已混樵渔。\n吉语来何晚，将军□素书。","collection":"宋","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":13137,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"兵乱后自嬄杂诗 其二十六","author":"吕本中","text":"重到江头宅，荒残足叹嗟。\n新乌忽栖树，旧犬已辞家。\n月淡初回梦，风轻不落花。\n相亲为部曲，弓剑作生涯。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":13138,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"兵乱后自嬄杂诗 其二十七","author":"吕本中","text":"偷生戎马内，室宇半摧残。\n假寐何曾着，惊魂尚未安。\n风前花自妥，雨后食犹寒。\n望断京华信，终宵泪不干。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":13139,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"兵乱后自嬄杂诗 其二十八","author":"吕本中","text":"忽复清明过，林园绿阴稠。\n光阴同毂转，身世着舟浮。\n旧识梁间燕，全生水上鸥。\n幸闻诸将辈，稍稍近前旒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":13140,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"兵乱后自嬄杂诗 其二十九","author":"吕本中","text":"岁间值狂寇，曾此驻戈鋋。\n台沼馀春草，图书散野烟。\n懒寻爱酒伴，愁起落花边。\n不忍登江阁，心随北斗悬。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":13141,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄题庄季裕静轩","author":"吕本中","text":"云静天如水，风停海不波。\n请观如是相，夫子意如何。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":13142,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"雪中奉简张子直","author":"吕本中","text":"深居畏雪谩添衣，过了梅花病不知。\n同住荒越懒还往，一年天气最寒时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":13143,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夜同李十步月至崔成美家","author":"吕本中","text":"伏暑不可去，客帆秋未回。\n偶携南县李，来访北桥崔。\n藤枕风前簟，瓜盘月下杯。\n十年老怀抱，姑为故人开。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":13144,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"读东坡诗","author":"吕本中","text":"命代风骚第一功，斯文到底为谁雄。\n太山北斗攀韩愈，琨玉秋霜敌孔融。\n不见陆机归洛下，只闻张翰过江东。\n广陵雅操无人继，六十馀年一梦中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":13145,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"读亡弟由义旧诗有感","author":"吕本中","text":"平昔乌衣游，盛事寄青史。\n后生见头角，唯子与夫子。\n奈何阻中涂，去我适蒿里。\n三年莫春日，西郊漫桃李。\n才难圣所叹，反是俗眼眯。\n坐看玉壶冰，终污青蝇矢。\n衔愤已成疾，伤谗空忍死。\n雪涕别时言，历历犹在耳。\n呜呼骨肉亲，遗恨有如此。\n吾生复亡聊，念尔中夜起。\n读君离别篇，沈吟泪如水。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":13146,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"与范益谦饮有怀才仲","author":"吕本中","text":"范郎醉倒西风前，夜思赵子起不眠。\n与渠别来今几年，细数往事如雷颠。\n尘埃刺促今尚贤，问我北行诗几篇。\n残篇断简弃不编，鹤鸣九皋鸢唳天。\n燕雀欲上无寅缘，江湖旧游性所便。\n我先往矣君加鞭，更呼赵子来同船。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":13147,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"感怀","author":"吕本中","text":"十年南北长为客，万里江山半是乡。\n梦里题诗随意了，醉中书字不成行。\n燕思公子归来早，草忆王孙恨更长。\n枕上不知多少事，觉来依旧熟黄粱。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":13148,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠唐虎","author":"吕本中","text":"白酒因循久绝倾，小诗聊复赠君行。\n故人若问庵中事，但道春来太瘦生。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":13149,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}}]